Limitations
Search and attraction discovery depend on the availability and configuration of the external API.
Favorites and search data are stored in the current browser rather than in a centralized user account or database.
The login link is present in the interface, but a complete authentication system is not implemented in the current code.
Booking flights and accommodations is outside the functionality currently implemented.

Future Improvements
Implement secure user authentication and account-based favorites.
Improve responsive layouts for mobile devices and tablets.
Add more robust error handling for failed API requests and empty search results.
Allow users to organize favorite attractions into individual trips.
Add trip itineraries and route-planning features.
Improve accessibility and form validation.
